OL,3,GNEWSACommunity bus to run along axed
OL,4,Acouncil route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community transport scheme is set to
OL,7,Ftake over a bus route that Shropshire
OL,8,FCouncil withdrew from.
OL,10,FShrewsbury Dial-a-Ride will operate
OL,11,Falong the previous 745 route in the
OL,12,Fsouth-west of the county from 2
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FResidents had started a petition when
OL,16,Fthe authority announced earlier in
OL,17,FAugust that the service would stop, due
OL,18,Fto what it described as a commercial
OL,19,Fdecision by operator Minsterley Motors.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
