OL,3,GNEWSACommunity bus to run along axed
OL,4,Acouncil route
OL,5,
OL,6,FShropshire Council and Shrewsbury
OL,7,FCommunity Transport Initiative have
OL,8,Fsince decided to launch the new scheme
OL,9,Fto help rural communities stay
OL,10,Fconnected to the services they rely on.
